8974686_1032424907825732_3935096735865419117_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gWZ5o3m1VrkQ7kNvwGJsoda&_nc_oc=AdpAwLY_l5opqH4J__SbP0-pgyXFdtO4IXIC7VeOVamWmcZtBDrlJTHob9PU3iw0jp4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3o1Rx3S-T31yjdr7YrlcEuD3iVTSk0tQmyCI06j3pmXg&oe=69F0C3AC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1659326611266834", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035357_1659326614600167_5868832121069241264_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hmmhup-Q5kIQ7kNvwFVU3vo&_nc_oc=AdppGy1mj-3RTKXY0NToAMWhHorMTMzRv_GTqrMNXxKE3zRGrt-R6JMU7DT21b79x_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af29kHueQjw8f385G7QIz7pRkI012ZDMOUbQxs8X8VJ5sA&oe=69F0BA0B"}, "display_name": "Dementia Reality", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Dementia Reality\u2122 is an innovative experiential caregiver training program using virtual reality technology to build empathy and understanding through an immersive caregiving experience. Dementia Reality utilizes both a caregiver\u2019s and first-person perspective of a person living with dementia to develop the skills and knowledge necessary to provide excellent person-centered care and improve outcomes. Each role specific training module is 1 hour long and includes worksheets and handouts to support the curriculum outside the classroom. Module-specific skills and learning objectives.", "short_description": "Dementia Reality is the first dementia instruction program combining skills training and real-life obstacles in a virtual environment. The outcome is more empathetic caregivers and happier, engaged residents, clients, patients, and family members. Dementia Reality\u2122 is a collaboration between CJE SeniorLife and Elderwerks Educational Services."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dementiareality.org/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Dementia Real